::: callout-important
## Why this matters day to day

Every model in this book needs priors, and a sceptical stakeholder may
ask you to justify them. The workflow you practised today —

> *state the prior → visualise it → run a prior predictive check → fit
> → show a sensitivity analysis*

— is exactly what a rigorous methods write-up contains. Do this and
your analysis is defensible.
:::

